
## Technology Stack

- **Android**: Kotlin, Android Studio, Jetpack libraries
- **iOS**: Swift, SwiftUI, Xcode
- **Backend**: Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB
- **Web Dashboard**: React, Redux, Chart.js, Tailwind CSS
- **Authentication**: JWT tokens
- **Database**: MongoDB
- **Hosting**: Docker, AWS/Heroku/DigitalOcean

## Installation

### For Users
1. Download from Google Play Store (Android) or App Store (iOS)
2. Create account and sign in
3. Access web dashboard at https://mobile-manager.app

